                    r3_coach_hint:          `Coaching, peer-consulting circles and structured reflection produce no lecture material — and are where behaviour change is rehearsed. Allocated out of the 144-day envelope.`,
                    r3_senior_label:        `Senior-professor share of teaching days vs practitioners & coaches (%)`,
                    r3_senior_readout:      `Scarce senior-professor time:`,
                    r3_senior_unit:         `% of teaching days`,
                    r3_senior_hint:         `Senior professors cost ~2× the faculty-days of practitioners and coaches. Loading them onto transfer work is expensive and tilts the journey back toward lecture.`,
