                    insight_rearchitected:  `Re-architected journey: you turned a 4.6/5 happy sheet into a journey that changes behaviour — transfer on a credible path to ≥65%, engagement held above the floor, and every outcome mapped and served. You fixed the application gap, not the content.`,
                    insight_sponsorsout:    `Transfer up, sponsors out: behaviour change rose, but engagement fell below the floor and the lead sponsor walked. Over-stretching loses the room — the rival school wins on exactly this. Stretch and energy are both constraints.`,
                    insight_thin:           `You lifted transfer toward target but the design is thin on coverage or sustainment. The Dean may be satisfied at the pitch, yet without every outcome mapped and measurement built in, the gain is fragile.`,
                    insight_short:          `You fell short of the ≥65% transfer target. The €1.4M sponsor block is still on review and LTC's flagship status is at risk. Re-examine which lever you under-used — most likely the action-learning project, spacing, or coaching time.`,
                    insight_lowengagement:  `Engagement dropped below the floor: relentless stretch makes people stop attending, and transfer can't happen in an empty room. The pilot that scored 3.2/5 is the warning.`,
